## New Component Rules (Creative Freedom)

When building components **not present** in the reference HTML:

1. Use only tokens from `luxora-color-tokens.mdc` — no new hex values
2. Use `Playfair Display` for any display/heading text, `Jost` for all UI/body text
3. Maintain **sharp corners** (`border-radius: 0`) on all interactive elements and cards
4. Keep section padding generous (`60px`–`96px` vertical on desktop)
5. Subtle depth via `rgba` overlays and box-shadows using `rgba(61,74,58,0.x)` — never hard drop shadows
6. Any new urgency/status element: refined, never flashing or loud
